{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">曹永廉（阿廉）即將於下月16日迎來62歲生日，日前一班極具心思的粉絲特地為他舉辦派對提早慶生！從網上曝光的生日會照片可見，粉絲們準備了一個充滿音樂元素的特色蛋糕，而出名錫Fans的阿廉亦毫無架子，與眾人熱情互動。保養得宜的他對著鏡頭展露標誌性的治癒笑容，其「凍齡」狀態引發網民熱議，紛紛留言激讚：「完全凍齡，笑容同電視裡一樣治癒」、「皮膚超好」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"94ca87b7-ac13-49ca-99fd-b3943f578a5a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026WZJjO3Q3vi1790651120.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"94ca87b7-ac13-49ca-99fd-b3943f578a5a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ad369847-b168-4c7b-a780-97090957aa62.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ox0DlLLCRf1790651120.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ad369847-b168-4c7b-a780-97090957aa62.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不過，這場生日會的最大亮點，絕對是乖乖陪伴爸爸出席的18歲大仔Brandon！驚喜亮相的Brandon身形高挑，留著一頭微鬈長髮，以簡約的白色T恤配搭漁夫帽示人。舉手投足間散發著陽光少年的氣質，不少網民都指他完美遺傳了爸爸的優良基因，高大靚仔的模樣成功搶去全場焦點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事實上，外型出眾的Brandon不但青出於藍，其音樂實力同樣不容小覷。早前阿廉與好兄弟蕭正楠、馬國明於內地開騷時，Brandon就曾以結他手身分上台為爸爸伴奏。兩父子同台帶來Rock爆演出，Brandon面對大場面全程零怯場之餘，更是星味爆燈！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"741455d7-d3e0-4b0c-8f79-dab7e76353bc.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BXwXqwGXKN1790651119.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"741455d7-d3e0-4b0c-8f79-dab7e76353bc.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T03:39:50.289432+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":430,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}